Count the Number of Even Numbers in a
Block

LXI H, 2050H ; HL → start of block
MVI B, 05H ; 5 numbers total
MVI C, 00H ; Even count = 0
LOOP:
MOV A, M ; Load current number into A
ANI 01H ; AND with 00000001
JNZ ODD ; If result ≠ 0, it's odd
INR C ; Even: increment count
ODD:
INX H ; Advance pointer
DCR B ; Decrement total counter
JNZ LOOP ; Repeat for all numbers
MOV A, C ; A = count of even numbers
HLT
